A||||79||Archie||Start Making Plans||||1||
Z||000000||Archie||12-23-2000||07:32 PM||||Mark your calendar for Saturday, April 21, 2001. We will be having our 4th. Annual "NIFE Open House & V-8 Seminar" at my shop in Barrington, IL (NW Side of Chicago).<P>The meeting/Seminar will be starting at 1:00 again this year. You will notice that this year we've managed to move the event back one month & hopefully we will have better weather.<P>This year we will have something new. If you arrive early or stay late, you will have a chance to take a ride in a V-8 Fiero. I will have 3 or 4 of my cars there and several of my customers will have their cars there and we will have several "Designated Drivers" available to take you for a test drive.<P>Everyone is invited, you don't have to be a member of NIFE or any other club to participate. Come visit Chicago in The Spring time, you won't want to leave.<P>This has always been a well attended meeting, growing by dozens each year, this year I'd like to surpass 100 attendees.<P>We will announce more on the specifics as time goes on. We will also be posting up pictures and specifics of the vehicles that will be available for test rides.<P>Archie||||reg||1
