Z||000007||Archie||12-25-2000||08:59 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by KnightRyder31:<BR><B>Count me in Archie. I would die to take a ride in a V8 Fiero!!! I'll be there. How far is Barrington, IL from the Michigan border?As you know, I live in Michigan...just wondering how long the drive would be.<BR>Thaks for giving the word.<BR>See ya Archie.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>From the Indiana/MI along Lake MI the shop is about 90 minutes. <P>The shop address is <BR>7 Hilldide Dr. #C<BR>Barrington, IL 60010<P>Punch that address up on on one of the Map servers on the Internet and you'll see that we are only a few hours from anywhere in North America. (only 20 minutes from O'Hare)<P>Archie<P>||||reg||1
