Z||000032||Archie||03-02-2001||09:15 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by elfiero:<BR><B>Standard,Jimmy,-instead of going all the way<BR>to chi-town,just come over to my house in<BR>golden valley and I'll let ya DRIVE my V8TPI<BR>fiero!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Feel free to start your own thread and invite anyone you'd like.<P>This event is more than just a couple of guys getting together. I would expect more than 100 people ALL of them Fiero nuts & all of them there to visit, have some fun and talk Fieros.<P>If you want to organize and event and come up with enough entertainment, rent 100 chairs, buy 15 cases of pop and have Sandwiches catered & can draw a crowd. Then more power to you, start your own thread and tell us all about it.<P>However, your post trying to keep people from  coming to Chicago smacks of competition. It is a negative post & should be withdrawn.<P>This event is much more than a little ride or a drive in a V-8 Fiero. <P>I'd love to let 100+ people drive one of my cars, but my shop insurance just won't allow it, but the local Cops would love it.<P>This event is actually a regular NIFE Club meeting and V-8 Fiero seminar. As at all NIFE meetings, visitors are welcome. Everyone on this Forum has been invited to be NIFE guests on this day. <P>Maybe you'd like to go heads up against the whole NIFE Club, but I don't think so.<P>Thank You.<P>Archie<P>P.S....Thanks for giving me the opportunity to move this to the top again.<BR>||||reg||1
