Z||000040||Archie||03-04-2001||07:51 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jimmy:<BR><B>    Archie     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Just hope I can put the finishing touches on mine in time(currently swapping the interior for another color). Hope to see everyone in April!<P>Jim <BR>87 GT V8 T-TOP <BR>87 GT</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Cool, well remember..... the people who drive V-8 Fieros to that meeting get the preferred parking right by the shop door.<P>All you have to do is Rev the engine about a block away and you will be directed to the good parking.<P>BTW, all parking in this area is free & it's not a conjested area. The V-8 Fiero Drivers just will not have to walk as far as those who drive their other cars.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Archie<p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 03-04-2001).]||||reg||1
