Z||000042||Archie||03-04-2001||11:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B> How far is that non V8 walk gonna be? I guess its not going to be like the Twin Lakes parking huh. All the Fieros arnt going to be in one spot?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>There is plenty of parking in the area and I'd say the longest walk would be 30 yards.<P>This isn't a general car show like at Bob's and We're not out in the middle of a field like he is.<P>Not to worry, you're young, you're strong, you'll be able to make it to the door.<P>Archie||||reg||1
