Z||000052||Oreif||04-09-2001||08:45 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B> I to am not sure how to get there..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Anyone from Illinois want to meet up and drive there, speek up   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Haze, Just take 59 north to route 14 and turn left. Go right on Hillview drive. It's like 3.5 miles from 59 just past Kelsey road. When you go down Hillview the road will turn to the right (now it's called Hillside drive).  Before you turn, Look straight ahead , the red brick building with the dirt/gravel drive, That's Archies place. To aid in finding it you should see a lot of Fiero's!<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
