Z||000075||Archie||04-20-2001||12:57 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tina:<BR><B>Aaaahhh,.....screamed Tina's V-8.<BR>Whole body shop full of parts,and I can't find nothing to wear to Archie's.  <BR>Tina     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Tina, We must live in a parallel universe, I have an '88 "T" top car at the shop that looks just like your car right now.<P>Archie<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-870s.jpg"> <P>The rear clip is just sitting on the chassis in this pic....... kinda being stored on the car until Monday. Then this thing gets a new Fino Body mounted.<p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 04-20-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000076||Archie||04-20-2001||12:54 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Archie:<BR><B> We will also be posting up pictures and specifics of the vehicles that will be available for test rides.<P>Archie</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-869s.jpg"> <P>The F-40 has a new Crate LM1 engine (appox. 270 HP) with a 650 Edelbrock Carb. It also has my 11.25" braking system on it with a 5-speed. This car has about 50 miles on it (I'll be adding to that this afternoon).<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-868s.jpg"> <P>The "T" top car has a new Crate LM1 engine (appox. 270 HP) with TPI. It also has "T" tops and a 5-speed. This car has about 5 miles on it (I'll be adding to that this afternoon).<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-867s.jpg"> <P>The Finale has a new Crate LM1 engine (appox. 270 HP) with TPI. It also has my 11.25" braking system on it with a 5-speed. This car has about 4000 miles on it.<P>BTW, If you don't want to wait for a V-8 car to be built for you, All of these cars are for sale.<P>Archie||||reg||1
Z||000077||BBBAD GT||04-20-2001||01:22 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Archie:<BR><B>  <BR>The F-40 has a new Crate LM1 engine (appox. 270 HP) with a 650 Edelbrock Carb. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Edelbrock makes a 650 carb?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero/V8sig.jpg">        <P><A HREF="http://home.att.net/~nomercy5.0/V8Specs.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8 For Sale</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A>||||reg||1
