Z||000079||Archie||04-20-2001||02:36 PM||||I need to make a correction...... The "T" top car, as shown above, that was supposed to be one of our Test Drive cars tomorrow has been benched. As stated earlier, I was going to add some miles to that car today. Well, less than 10 miles on the car and the clutch slips like a bandit.<P>Some time ago someone talked me into testing a new clutch on my V-8 cars. He had wanted me to just switch over to use his clutch (sell it to others), but I refused to switch without testing to make sure it worked. I will not sell something to my customers that I haven't tested myself. So I agreed to try one out. Well, guess what, this "T" top car is the one I decided to test it on. Even with mild driving, it's slipping.  Back to the drawing board. <P>I should have known better, less than 10 miles and now I gotta R&R to replace that clutch.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> Archie<P>||||reg||1
